{"src":"de","tgt":"en","rate":24000,"room_opened_ms_before":1500,"err":"","clip_ms":214500,"events":[{"kind":"hello","type":"hello","lang":"en","src":"de","rate":24000,"mode":"utterance","edition":"nonprofit","context":true},{"kind":"input","t":8580.631256,"text":"Im Jahr 1990 wurde es aufgrund der Bedrohung durch Wüstensand zur Liste der gefährdeten Weltkulturerbegebiete hinzugefügt."},{"kind":"text","t":8973.850171,"text":"In 1990, it was added to the list of endangered World Heritage sites due to the threat from desert sand."},{"kind":"audio","t":9032.862695,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9034.506318000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9035.737352,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9037.1401,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1220},{"kind":"audio","t":9038.802603,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":9040.292723,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":770},{"kind":"input","t":14619.62398,"text":"Wenn Sie den Film Das Vermächtnis der Tempelritter gesehen haben,"},{"kind":"text","t":14827.526496999999,"text":"If you’ve watched the movie The Templar Legacy,"},{"kind":"audio","t":14871.364209,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14872.584453,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":14872.988992000002,"samples":15464,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":40},{"kind":"input","t":20972.889057,"text":"Denken Sie vielleicht, dass auf der Rückseite der Unabhängigkeitserklärung eine Schatzkarte gezeichnet wurde."},{"kind":"text","t":21262.789385,"text":"You might think that a treasure map was drawn on the back of the Declaration of Independence."},{"kind":"audio","t":21307.172988000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21308.572446000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21310.089976,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":21311.689028,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":21312.050085,"samples":12928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":33738.426734999994,"text":"Kinder werden aus einer Vielzahl von Gründen in Pflegefamilien untergebracht, und zwar aus verschiedenen Gründen, die von Vernachlässigung über Missbrauch bis hin zur Erpressung reichen."},{"kind":"text","t":34031.533377,"text":"Children are placed in foster families for various reasons, ranging from neglect and abuse to coercion."},{"kind":"audio","t":34077.490771,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34078.887219,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34080.464159999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1160},{"kind":"audio","t":34082.071332,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":260,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34084.045031999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":34084.513140999996,"samples":20960,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":250},{"kind":"input","t":44814.495505,"text":"Das Cochamo-Tal Chiles wichtigstes Kletterziel, bekannt als der Josemite National Park von Südamerika mit einer Vielzahl von großen Granitwänden und Klippen."},{"kind":"text","t":45294.730051,"text":"The Cochamo Valley is Chile’s most important climbing destination, known as South America’s version of Yosemite National Park, featuring numerous large granite walls and cliffs."},{"kind":"audio","t":45358.175294,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45359.547641,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":45361.164693,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45362.706494,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45364.385796999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45366.011019,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45367.617151,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45369.344556,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":45370.984798,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":45371.151232,"samples":9888,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":51539.613091,"text":"Aristoteles' Ansichten zu allen Wissenschaftsfragen einschließlich der Psychologie waren anerkannt."},{"kind":"text","t":51804.628095,"text":"Aristotle's views on all scientific matters, including psychology, were recognized."},{"kind":"audio","t":51850.158391,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51851.496456999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51853.093789,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51854.67121,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":30,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":51855.886855,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":570},{"kind":"input","t":62212.833335999996,"text":"Wenn Sie es nicht gewohnt sind, auf Landstraßen zu fahren, bleiben Sie achtsam. Steiles Gefälle, enge Fahrbahnen und scharfe Kurven überwiegen hier."},{"kind":"text","t":62477.678455999994,"text":"If you’re not used to driving on country roads, stay cautious. Steep slopes, narrow roads, and sharp turns predominate here."},{"kind":"audio","t":62527.084379,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62528.630939999995,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1310},{"kind":"audio","t":62530.091368999994,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":230,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":62530.254332,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"audio","t":62563.741469,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62565.184176999996,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":62566.763819,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1180},{"kind":"audio","t":62566.938292,"samples":9696,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":73256.458572,"text":"Die Gegenwart eines echten, unsichtbaren Teams, Larsson und Lafasto, 1989, Seite 109."},{"kind":"text","t":73678.806986,"text":"The presence of a real, invisible team, Larsson and Lafasto, 1989, page 109."},{"kind":"audio","t":73726.088647,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73727.422133,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":73728.992114,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73730.613757,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73732.256259,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":73733.611096,"samples":29360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":590},{"kind":"input","t":77707.876806,"text":"ist auch ein einzigartiger Bestandteil eines virtuellen Teams."},{"kind":"text","t":77900.64775199999,"text":"It is also a unique component of a virtual team."},{"kind":"audio","t":77941.177218,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77942.480194,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":77943.931583,"samples":32264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":760},{"kind":"input","t":87202.878727,"text":"Nach dem Unfall wurde Gibson in ein Krankenhaus gebracht."},{"kind":"text","t":87395.544801,"text":"After the accident, Gibson was taken to a hospital."},{"kind":"audio","t":87437.323342,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":87438.311842,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":340,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":87439.91404399999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":87440.031046,"samples":2496,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":91086.95406199999,"text":"Er verstarb jedoch kurz darauf."},{"kind":"text","t":91205.10599299999,"text":"He passed away shortly after."},{"kind":"audio","t":91242.879715,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":91244.081349,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":810},{"kind":"audio","t":91244.224802,"samples":464,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":96639.001787,"text":"Viele deutsche Backwaren beinhalten außerdem Mandeln, Haselnüsse oder andere Nüsse."},{"kind":"text","t":96899.04938099999,"text":"Many German baked goods also contain almonds, hazelnuts, or other nuts."},{"kind":"audio","t":96942.663019,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":420,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96944.01162599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96945.587737,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":96947.305111,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1020},{"kind":"audio","t":96947.424944,"samples":3928,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":101432.033818,"text":"Beliebte Kuchen passen häufig besonders gut zu einer Tasse starken Kaffees."},{"kind":"text","t":101655.240259,"text":"Popular cakes often pair especially well with a cup of strong coffee."},{"kind":"audio","t":101697.336937,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1270},{"kind":"audio","t":101698.690754,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":180,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101700.37118799999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":101701.61775199999,"samples":27696,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":540},{"kind":"input","t":107144.08211599999,"text":"Wenn man eine romanische Sprache spricht, ist es natürlich leichter, Portugiesisch zu erlernen."},{"kind":"text","t":107393.258394,"text":"If you speak a Romance language, it’s naturally easier to learn Portuguese."},{"kind":"audio","t":107436.449844,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107437.77447,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107439.37222199999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":107441.015915,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":890},{"kind":"audio","t":107441.13543699999,"samples":2128,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":116047.740161,"text":"Die Klang- und Lichtshow bei den Pyramiden ist eine der interessantesten Attraktionen für Kinder in der Gegend."},{"kind":"text","t":116396.810207,"text":"The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area."},{"kind":"audio","t":116443.51501599999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116444.910314,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":116446.449804,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1190},{"kind":"audio","t":116448.124238,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":116449.74309999999,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":10,"off":1240},{"kind":"audio","t":116450.015675,"samples":11960,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":126793.256044,"text":"Verkehrsfluss ist die Untersuchung der Bewegung einzelner Fahrer und Fahrzeuge zwischen zwei Punkten und der Interaktionen, die zwischen beiden stattfinden."},{"kind":"text","t":127170.128313,"text":"Traffic flow is the study of the movement of individual drivers and vehicles between two points and the interactions that occur between them."},{"kind":"audio","t":127220.063447,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1210},{"kind":"audio","t":127221.447784,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127223.068646,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127224.675808,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127226.308441,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1070},{"kind":"audio","t":127227.961394,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":130,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":127229.703788,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":40,"off":900},{"kind":"audio","t":127229.830271,"samples":4024,"rate":24000},{"kind":"input","t":137825.263618,"text":"Der Australier Mitchell Gurley wurde 11. im stehenden Super-G der Männer. Der tschechische Konkurrent Aldrich Jelinek wurde 16. im sitzenden Super-G der Männer."},{"kind":"text","t":138165.751893,"text":"Australian Mitchell Gurley became the 11th. Men's standing Super-G. The Czech competitor Aldrich Jelinek finished in 16th place. Men's sitting Super-G."},{"kind":"audio","t":138207.18298800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138208.616256,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":220,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138209.511674,"samples":23264,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":430},{"kind":"audio","t":138248.328236,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138249.759605,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138251.470529,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":138253.17536300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1350},{"kind":"audio","t":138254.339706,"samples":26728,"rate":24000,"on":70,"off":540},{"kind":"audio","t":138287.70549000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":390,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":138288.20141,"samples":20632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":330},{"kind":"input","t":148933.228344,"text":"Das Haitianische Institut für Gerechtigkeit und Demokratie hat auf unabhängigen Studien verwiesen, die nahelegen, dass das nepalesische UN-Friedensbataillon die Krankheit unwissentlich"},{"kind":"text","t":149332.751804,"text":"The Haitian Institute for Justice and Democracy cited independent studies suggesting that the Nepalese UN peacekeeping battalion spread the disease unintentionally"},{"kind":"audio","t":149384.726608,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149386.139136,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149387.706837,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149389.36013000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":940},{"kind":"audio","t":149391.07390400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":149392.728207,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149394.342799,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149396.02591300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":149397.144745,"samples":26456,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":460},{"kind":"input","t":151485.04638,"text":"nach Haiti eingeschleppt hat."},{"kind":"text","t":151591.85302500002,"text":"imported to Haiti."},{"kind":"audio","t":151629.79510000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":151630.15860700002,"samples":17032,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":140},{"kind":"input","t":158644.730703,"text":"Bald nach dem Ausbruch von Kampfhandlungen initiierte Großbritannien eine Seeblockade gegen Deutschland."},{"kind":"text","t":158909.877719,"text":"Shortly after the outbreak of hostilities, Britain imposed a naval blockade on Germany."},{"kind":"audio","t":158953.439416,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":380,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158954.81102300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1330},{"kind":"audio","t":158956.36524400002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158958.028197,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":158959.16103000002,"samples":26128,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":450},{"kind":"input","t":167074.818115,"text":"Er griff auch alles an, was ins Wasser kam. Selbst ein großer Dinosaurier wie der T-Rex war ihm nicht gewachsen."},{"kind":"text","t":167373.69127200003,"text":"He also attacked anything that entered the water. Even a giant dinosaur like the T-Rex was no match for him."},{"kind":"audio","t":167415.43257200002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1290},{"kind":"audio","t":167416.878001,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":90,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167417.630306,"samples":20864,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":270},{"kind":"audio","t":167453.887227,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":410,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167455.28306500003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167456.892927,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":167457.59588100002,"samples":19296,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":190},{"kind":"input","t":179088.207056,"text":"Die Verwendung von Videoaufzeichnungen führte zu wichtigen Erkenntnissen für die Deutung von Mikroexpressionen, wenige Millisekunden dauernden Gesichtsbewegungen."},{"kind":"text","t":179460.386532,"text":"The use of video recordings led to important insights for interpreting microexpressions, facial movements that last just a few milliseconds."},{"kind":"audio","t":179510.80720500002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179512.21698300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179513.806095,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179515.48797800002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179517.05384,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179518.63909100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179520.261063,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":179520.786644,"samples":15424,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":50},{"kind":"input","t":188355.634819,"text":"Die Ankündigung erfolgte nach einem Telefongespräch von Trump mit dem türkischen Präsidenten Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"text","t":188645.324943,"text":"The announcement came after a phone call between Trump and Turkish President Recep Tayyip."},{"kind":"audio","t":188690.701956,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188692.110644,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188693.689286,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188695.299688,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":188695.993171,"samples":18928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":90},{"kind":"input","t":199685.334357,"text":"Es gibt Familienstrände, die manchmal überlaufen sind, mit einer schönen Einkaufspromenade entlang der Küste, das Schwimmen ist hier sicher."},{"kind":"text","t":200071.522751,"text":"There are family beaches that can be crowded at times, with a nice promenade along the coast; swimming here is safe."},{"kind":"audio","t":200116.34578300003,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":400,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200117.792762,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200119.36528300002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200121.013466,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200121.888753,"samples":21928,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":350},{"kind":"audio","t":200151.37941000002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":370,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":200151.672216,"samples":17632,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":210},{"kind":"input","t":212338.809075,"text":"Die meisten der kleineren Inseln sind unabhängige Nationen oder zu Frankreich gehörig und als luxuriöse Seebäder."},{"kind":"text","t":212642.932466,"text":"Most of the smaller islands are independent nations or part of France and serve as luxurious seaside resorts."},{"kind":"audio","t":212680.37614100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":430,"off":1340},{"kind":"audio","t":212681.747328,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":20,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212683.30538900002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212684.90170100002,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212686.619535,"samples":32768,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":1360},{"kind":"audio","t":212688.117525,"samples":32360,"rate":24000,"on":0,"off":790},{"kind":"close","t":224505.42777500002,"code":1005}]}